  "body": "A wonderful 2 Bedroom Apartment with chattels included. The property is one of the best if not the best listing.\r\n\r\nPositioned beautifully on the second floor, with a spacious deck, beautiful sunsets and a part view of the sea. \r\n\r\nThis wonderful modern apartment built in 2014 will delight the hearts of many first time home buyers, downsizers, retirees, investors or a small family. With two private car parks and with your safety in mind, the complex is fitted with modern security cameras, swipe card access and a lift.\r\n\r\nClose by is a selection of Shops, Supermarkets, Cinema, Library, Cafes, Restaurants, Schools including the Stanmore Bay Leisure Center, Skate Park, Football Grounds only about 1.5 km walking distance. Also surrounded by many beautiful beaches, and playgrounds for the kids.\r\n\r\n\r\nKey features & highlights:\r\n•\tContemporary, low-maintenance design - stylish and hassle-free living \r\n•\tTwo spacious bedrooms \r\n•\tOpen-plan kitchen, dining and living area \r\n•\tPrivate outdoor balcony with a sunny outlook\r\n•\tTwo dedicated parking spaces, plus plenty of visitor parking\r\n•\tSecure complex\r\n•\tBuilt with durable concrete tilt slab construction\r\n•\tHeat pump / air-conditioning unit\r\n•\tShade blinds, and new block out curtains  \r\n•\tHot water cupboard with shelving\r\n•\tEasy access to public transport, local parks & recreation spots \r\n•\tSuitable for first home buyers, investors, including small families and retirees\r\n•\tSurrounded by beautiful beaches and stunning nature in the area\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment. \r\nDon’t miss this opportunity.",
